i>               <li>Log into your Domain Registrar (GoDaddy, Hostinger, etc.).</li>               <li>Add a new <strong>CNAME</strong> record:                 <ul class="list-disc pl-4 mt-1 font-mono text-xs bg-white/50 p-2 rounded border border-blue-100">                   <li>Name/Host: <strong>@</strong> (or www)</li>                   <li>Value/Target: <strong>cname.vercel-dns.com</strong></li>                 </ul>               </li>               <li>Wait 15-30 minutes for DNS to propagate. SSL will be issued automatically.</li>             </ol>           </div>            <div>             <label for="custom_domain" class="block text-sm font-medium text-secondary mb-1">Primary Custom Domain</label>             <div class="flex gap-3">               <input                  id="custom_domain"                  type="text"                  name="custom_domain"                  value={settings.custom_domain || ''}                  placeholder="e.g. mybrand.com"                  class="flex-1 px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm"                />               {settings.custom_domain && (                 <button type="button" id="remove-domain-btn" class="px-4 py-2 bg-red-50 text-red-600 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold border border-red-100 hover:bg-red-100 transition-colors">                   Remove                 </button>               )}             </div>             {settings.custom_domain ? (               <div id="primary-domain-status-container" class="mt-3 p-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 flex flex-col gap-2">                 <div class="flex justify-between items-center">                   <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-secondary">Status: <span id="primary-domain-status-badge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 animate-pulse">Checking...</span></div>                   <button type="button" onclick="checkDomainStatus(document.getElementById(