ct Us Page           </div>           <span class="text-primary group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg></span>         </summary>         <form class="settings-section-form border-t border-gray-100" data-page="Contact Us">           <div class="p-6 space-y-6">             <p class="text-xs text-secondary/60 mb-4">The headings on the Contact Us page will dynamically prefix the Brand Name. Fill in the content for each section below.</p>              <div>               <label for="contact_title" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Page Title</label>               <input id="contact_title" name="contact_title" type="text" value={settings.contact_title || 'Get in Touch'} class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm" />             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="contact_subtitle" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Page Subtitle</label>               <textarea id="contact_subtitle" name="contact_subtitle" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.contact_subtitle || 'Have a question about our products, a bulk order inquiry, or just want to say hello? We\'d love to hear from you.'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="contact_address" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Address</label>               <textarea id="contact_address" name="contact_address" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.contact_address || '123 Demo Street\nCity, State\n123456\nCountry'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="contact_email" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Email Address</label>               <input id="contact_email" name="contact_email" type="text" value={settings.contact_email || 'contact@yourstore.com'} class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm" />             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="contact_phone" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Phone Number</label>               <input id="contact_phone" name="contact_phone" type="text" value={settings.contact_phone || '+91 9876543210'} class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm" />             </div>              <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 mt-4">               <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-secondary mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-gray-100">Bank Details & B2B Terms</h3>               <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">                 <div>                   <label for="bank_name" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Bank Name & Branch</label>                   <input type="text" id="bank_name" name="bank_name" value={settings.bank_name || 'Axis Bank, TRANSPORT NAGAR City'} class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm" />                 </div>                 <div>                   <label for="bank_account_name" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Account Name</label>                   <input type="text" id="bank_account_name" name="bank_account_name" value={settings.bank_account_name || 'Company Name'} class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm" />                 </div>                 <div>                   <label for="bank_account" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Account Number</label>                   <input type="text" id="bank_account" name="bank_account" value={settings.bank_account || '923020055745423'} class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm" />                 </div>                 <div>                   <label for="bank_ifsc" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">IFSC Code</label>                   <input type="text" id="bank_ifsc" name="bank_ifsc" value={settings.bank_ifsc || 'UTIB0002573'} class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm" />                 </div>                 <div>                   <label for="authorized_signatory" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Authorized Signatory Name</label>                   <input type="text" id="authorized_signatory" name="authorized_signatory" value={settings.authorized_signatory || 'Company Name (Store Name)'} class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm" />                 </div>                 <div class="md:col-span-3">                   <label for="b2b_terms" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">B2B Terms & Conditions (Line separated)</label>                   <textarea id="b2b_terms" name="b2b_terms" rows="4" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.b2b_terms || `1. Thanks for doing business with us. 2. Interest will be charged @24% if payment is not made within 30 days. 3. Goods once sold will not be taken back. 4. GST and other taxes as applicable. 5. All disputes are subject to City jurisdiction only.`}</textarea>                 </div>               </div>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="contact_hours" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Business Hours</label>               <textarea id="contact_hours" name="contact_hours" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.contact_hours || 'Monday - Saturday: 9:00 AM - 6:00 PM<br/>Sunday: Closed'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />            </div>           <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-100 flex justify-end">             <button type="submit" class="btn-primary flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-2 text-sm" onclick="return confirm('Are you sure you want to save the Contact Us page?')">               <span class="save-btn-text">Save Contact Us</span>               <svg class="save-btn-spinner hidden animate-spin h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle><path class="opacity-75" fill="currentColor" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4z"></path></svg>             </button>           </div>         </form>       </details>             </div>      <div data-tab-content="policies" class="tab-panel space-y-6 hidden">       <!-- Return & Refund Policy Settings -->       <form class="settings-section-form bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden mb-8">         <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50">           <h2 class="font-bold text-secondary flex items-center gap-2">             <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 15v-1a4 4 0 00-4-4H8m0 0l3 3m-3-3l3-3m9 14V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16l4-2 4 2 4-2 4 2z" /></svg>             Global Return & Refund Policy Configuration           </h2>           <p class="text-xs text-secondary/60">Configure how return/refund requests are handled across the admin panel.</p>         </div>         <div class="p-6 space-y-6">           <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">             <div>               <label for="return_policy_type" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Return Policy Workflow</label>               <select id="return_policy_type" name="return_policy_type" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">                 <option value="standard" selected={settings.return_policy_type === 'standard'}>Standard Returns (Reverse Pickup)</option>                 <option value="video_proof" selected={settings.return_policy_type === 'video_proof' || !settings.return_policy_type}>Refund/Replace on Video Proof Only</option>                 <option value="no_returns" selected={settings.return_policy_type === 'no_returns'}>No Returns or Refunds Allowed</option>               </select>               <p class="text-xs text-secondary/60 mt-1">This changes the UI in the Orders &gt; Returns dashboard.</p>             </div>             <div>               <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Return Window Validity</label>               <div class="flex gap-2">                 <input id="return_window_value" name="return_window_value" type="number" min="0" value={settings.return_window_value || '7'} class="flex-1 px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm" />                 <select id="return_window_unit" name="return_window_unit" class="w-32 px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">                   <option value="days" selected={settings.return_window_unit === 'days' || !settings.return_window_unit}>Days</option>                   <option value="hours" selected={settings.return_window_unit === 'hours'}>Hours</option>                 </select>               </div>               <p class="text-xs text-secondary/60 mt-1">Example: 7 Days or 48 Hours.</p>             </div>           </div>           <div>             <label for="return_policy_instructions" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Customer Instructions (Optional)</label>             <textarea id="return_policy_instructions" name="return_policy_instructions" rows="3" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm" placeholder="Please send an unboxing video to our WhatsApp number...">{settings.return_policy_instructions || ''}</textarea>             <p class="text-xs text-secondary/60 mt-1">These instructions will be displayed on the frontend when the customer requests a return/refund.</p>           </div>         </div>         <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-100 flex justify-end">           <button type="submit" class="btn-primary flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-2 text-sm">             <span class="save-btn-text">Save Policy Settings</span>             <svg class="save-btn-spinner hidden animate-spin h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle><path class="opacity-75" fill="currentColor" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4z"></path></svg>           </button>         </div>       </form>        <!-- Privacy Policy Content -->       <details data-page="Privacy Policy" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden mb-4">         <summary class="px-6 py-4 cursor-pointer font-bold text-secondary bg-gray-50 flex justify-between items-center marker:hidden">           <div class="flex items-center gap-2">             <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" /></svg>             Privacy Policy Page           </div>           <span class="text-primary group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg></span>         </summary>         <form class="settings-section-form border-t border-gray-100" data-page="Privacy Policy">           <div class="p-6 space-y-6">             <p class="text-xs text-secondary/60 mb-4">The headings on the Privacy Policy page will dynamically prefix the Brand Name. Fill in the content for each section below.</p>              <div>               <label for="page_privacy_policy_0" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Introduction</label>               <textarea id="page_privacy_policy_0" name="page_privacy_policy_0" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_privacy_policy_0 || '<p>At Store Name, your privacy is a top priority. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your personal data when you visit <a href=&quot;https://www.yourstore.com/&quot;>https://www.yourstore.com/</a> or make a purchase from our website. By accessing or using our website, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy.</p>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_privacy_policy_1" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Information We Collect</label>               <textarea id="page_privacy_policy_1" name="page_privacy_policy_1" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_privacy_policy_1 || '<p>When you interact with our website, we may collect the following types of personal information:</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Personal Identification Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, billing address, shipping address, and payment information when making a purchase.</li>\n    <li><strong>Non-personal Identification Information:</strong> IP address, browser type, device type, and information collected through cookies and tracking technologies.</li>\n  </ul>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_privacy_policy_2" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">How We Use Your Information</label>               <textarea id="page_privacy_policy_2" name="page_privacy_policy_2" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_privacy_policy_2 || '<p>We use your information for the following purposes:</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>To process and complete your transactions.</li>\n    <li>To communicate with you regarding your orders or inquiries.</li>\n    <li>To improve the functionality and user experience of our website.</li>\n    <li>To send you promotional emails or newsletters, if you opt-in.</li>\n    <li>To comply with legal obligations and resolve disputes, if necessary.</li>\n  </ul>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_privacy_policy_3" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Sharing Your Information</label>               <textarea id="page_privacy_policy_3" name="page_privacy_policy_3" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_privacy_policy_3 || '<p>We value your privacy and will never sell, trade, or rent your personal data to third parties. However, we may share your information with trusted third parties to help facilitate certain functions of our business, including:</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Payment processors (to complete transactions).</li>\n    <li>Shipping companies (to deliver products).</li>\n    <li>Email service providers (for newsletters and promotional content).</li>\n    <li>Legal authorities, if required by law.</li>\n  </ul>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_privacy_policy_4" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Security of Your Information</label>               <textarea id="page_privacy_policy_4" name="page_privacy_policy_4" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_privacy_policy_4 || '<p>We take reasonable precautions to protect your personal information. Our website is secured with SSL encryption, and we follow industry-standard security practices to ensure your data is safe. However, no method of electronic transmission or storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_privacy_policy_5" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Cookies and Tracking Technologies</label>               <textarea id="page_privacy_policy_5" name="page_privacy_policy_5" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_privacy_policy_5 || '<p>We use cookies and other tracking technologies to enhance your browsing experience. Cookies are small files stored on your device that help us analyze web traffic, improve site functionality, and provide a personalized user experience. You may choose to disable cookies in your browser settings, but doing so may affect the functionality of our website.</p>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_privacy_policy_6" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Your Rights</label>               <textarea id="page_privacy_policy_6" name="page_privacy_policy_6" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_privacy_policy_6 || '<p>You have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Access:</strong> You can request a copy of the personal data we have about you.</li>\n    <li><strong>Correction:</strong> You can request correction of any inaccuracies in your personal data.</li>\n    <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> You can request the deletion of your personal data, subject to certain legal obligations.</li>\n    <li><strong>Opt-out:</strong> You can unsubscribe from our marketing emails at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link in our emails or contacting us directly.</li>\n  </ul>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_privacy_policy_7" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Third-party Links</label>               <textarea id="page_privacy_policy_7" name="page_privacy_policy_7" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_privacy_policy_7 || '<p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. Please note that we are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of these sites. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party sites you visit.</p>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_privacy_policy_8" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Changes to this Privacy Policy</label>               <textarea id="page_privacy_policy_8" name="page_privacy_policy_8" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_privacy_policy_8 || '<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices, technology, or legal requirements. Any updates will be posted on this page with an updated Effective Date at the top. We encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_privacy_policy_9" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Childrens Privacy</label>               <textarea id="page_privacy_policy_9" name="page_privacy_policy_9" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_privacy_policy_9 || '<p>Our website is not intended for use by individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe we have inadvertently collected personal data from a child, please contact us immediately so we can remove such information.</p>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_privacy_policy_10" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Contact Us</label>               <textarea id="page_privacy_policy_10" name="page_privacy_policy_10" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_privacy_policy_10 || '<p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our practices, or if you wish to exercise any of your rights, please contact us at:</p>\n  <p>\n    <strong>Company Name (Store Name)</strong><br />\n    123 Demo Street,<br />\n 