be processed, and a credit will automatically be applied to your original method of payment within 7-10 business days.</p>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_refund_policy_2" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Delivery Costs</label>               <textarea id="page_refund_policy_2" name="page_refund_policy_2" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_refund_policy_2 || '<p>You will be responsible for paying for your own Delivery costs for returning your item.</p>\n  <p>Delivery costs are non-refundable.</p>\n  <p>If you receive a refund, the cost of return Delivery will be deducted from your refund.</p>\n  <p>If you have any questions regarding our refund policy, feel free to reach out to us.</p>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_refund_policy_3" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Disclaimer</label>               <textarea id="page_refund_policy_3" name="page_refund_policy_3" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{settings.page_refund_policy_3 || '<p><strong>&quot;Please note that, for hygiene reasons, we are unable to accept returns or exchanges on products that are not defective. All products are thoroughly inspected before shipment to ensure quality.&quot;</strong></p>'}</textarea>             </div>             <hr class="border-gray-100" />              <div>               <label for="page_refund_policy_4" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-secondary mb-1">Contact Us</label>               <textarea id="page_refund_policy_4" name="page_refund_policy_4" rows="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary text-sm">{setting